            "alias": "草地私会 改版",
            "prompt": "2girls,cowgirl shot,lying on grass,from above,smile,In a secluded grove deep within a forest, where sunlight filters down in warm, hazy shafts through the dense emerald canopy, girl holds girl in a tender embrace. The light dapples the forest floor, illuminating floating dust motes and creating an ethereal glow around them, isolating them in a pocket of profound quietude.the girl, her usual sharp demeanor softened by an intense, protective tenderness, leans down to press a soft, lingering kiss on girl's forehead.girl, cradled securely in her arms, appears serene with her eyes closed and a soft, contented smile gracing her lips, fully immersed in the warm intimacy of the moment. Her light-colored, nature-themed attire seems to absorb the gentle light, while girl's darker clothing provides a contrasting depth. The air is still and warm, filled only with the distant, muted sounds of the forest, heightening the sense of a private world shared only by them. The scene is suffused with a gentle, almost sacred intimacy, hinting at a deep, complex bond that flourishes in ther sun-kissed, hidden sanctuary.photographic reference, photo background, 3d background, 3D render, 3DCG,3::cinematic angle, cinematic lighting::, 3::lens flare::,highly finished, Character Study, amazing quality, absurdres, best quality,white flower field,foreshortening,blurry foreground,",
